## 2. Decision D-2: Shared Adapter Types & Re-Export Strategy

### Shared Types Definition (`packages/web/src/grid/interaction/types/adapter.types.ts`)
- Generic over `TRegistered`: `GridAllDayDragTarget<TRegistered>`, `GridAllDayResizeTarget<TRegistered>`, `GridTimedDragTarget<TRegistered>`, `GridTimedResizeTarget<TRegistered>`, `GridInteractionTarget<TRegistered>`, `GridResolvedEventTarget<TRegistered>`.
- View-agnostic commit results: `GridAllDayDragCommitResult`, `GridAllDayResizeCommitResult`, `GridTimedDragCommitResult`, `GridTimedResizeCommitResult`, `GridInteractionCommitResult`.
- Generic visual union: `GridInteractionVisual<TColumnKey = string>`.
- Common lifecycle: `GridInteractionPointerOwnership`.

### Per-View Re-Exports
All 25 external import sites continue importing from `views/Week/interaction` or `views/Day/interaction` with zero changes:
- [`packages/web/src/views/Week/interaction/adapter/week-interaction.adapter.types.ts`](file:///home/sainadh/projects/compass-calendar/compass/compass-calendar/packages/web/src/views/Week/interaction/adapter/week-interaction.adapter.types.ts): Re-exports aliases `WeekAllDayDragTarget = GridAllDayDragTarget<WeekRegisteredEventTarget>`, `WeekInteractionCommitResult = GridInteractionCommitResult`, `WeekInteractionVisual = GridInteractionVisual<DateColumnKey>`, retaining Week-specific `WeekInteractionRuntime`, `WeekInteractionAdapterOptions`, and `WeekInteractionAdapter`.
- [`packages/web/src/views/Day/interaction/adapter/day-interaction.adapter.types.ts`](file:///home/sainadh/projects/compass-calendar/compass/compass-calendar/packages/web/src/views/Day/interaction/adapter/day-interaction.adapter.types.ts): Re-exports aliases `DayAllDayDragTarget = GridAllDayDragTarget<DayRegisteredEventTarget>`, `DayInteractionCommitResult = GridInteractionCommitResult`, `DayInteractionVisual = GridInteractionVisual<DayColumnKey>`, retaining Day-specific options and runtime.

