## 3. Type-Flow Analysis: Column Key Threading

Tracing the column key across the stack from layout options to drag visual state:

```
1. GridLayoutCacheOptions<TColumnKey>.visibleDates: TColumnKey[]
   ↓ (passed into buildDayColumns(rect, visibleDates))
2. DayColumnCache<TColumnKey>.date: TColumnKey
   ↓ (cached in GridLayoutCache<TColumnKey>.dayColumns)
3. getNearestDayColumn / placement.column.date
   ↓ (assigned in math/timed.drag.ts & math/all-day.drag.ts)
4. TimedDragVisual<TColumnKey>.dayDate: TColumnKey
   TimedDragVisual<TColumnKey>.initialDayDate: TColumnKey
   AllDayDragVisual<TColumnKey>.dayDate: TColumnKey
   AllDayDragVisual<TColumnKey>.initialDayDate: TColumnKey
   ↓ (consumed by commit handlers)
5. Week: commit/timed.commit.ts & commit/cross-row.commit.ts (DateColumnKey -> ISO date math)
   Day: adapter/commit/timed.commit.ts (DayColumnKey -> columnMoveCalendarId -> CalendarId)
```

### Declarations Modified:
1. [`packages/web/src/grid/interaction/layout.cache.ts`](file:///home/sainadh/projects/compass-calendar/compass/compass-calendar/packages/web/src/grid/interaction/layout.cache.ts): `GridLayoutCacheOptions<TColumnKey>`, `DayColumnCache<TColumnKey>`, `GridLayoutCache<TColumnKey>`, `BuildDayColumnsInput<TColumnKey>`, `buildTimedGridLayoutCache`, `buildAllDayGridLayoutCache`, `buildDragGridLayoutCache`, `buildDayColumns`, `getNearestDayColumn`.
2. [`packages/web/src/grid/interaction/types/timed-drag.types.ts`](file:///home/sainadh/projects/compass-calendar/compass/compass-calendar/packages/web/src/grid/interaction/types/timed-drag.types.ts): `TimedDragVisual<TColumnKey>`. `dayDate: TColumnKey`, `initialDayDate: TColumnKey`.
3. [`packages/web/src/grid/interaction/types/all-day-drag.types.ts`](file:///home/sainadh/projects/compass-calendar/compass/compass-calendar/packages/web/src/grid/interaction/types/all-day-drag.types.ts): `AllDayDragVisual<TColumnKey>`. `dayDate: TColumnKey`, `initialDayDate: TColumnKey`.
4. [`packages/web/src/grid/interaction/commit/cross-row.commit.ts`](file:///home/sainadh/projects/compass-calendar/compass/compass-calendar/packages/web/src/grid/interaction/commit/cross-row.commit.ts): `allDayDragVisualToTimedGridEvent` and `timedDragVisualToAllDayGridEvent` parameter types pinned to `<DateColumnKey>`.
5. [`packages/web/src/views/Day/interaction/adapter/commit/timed.commit.ts`](file:///home/sainadh/projects/compass-calendar/compass/compass-calendar/packages/web/src/views/Day/interaction/adapter/commit/timed.commit.ts): `columnMoveCalendarId` parameter type updated to `Pick<TimedDragVisual<DayColumnKey>, "dayDate" | "initialDayDate">`.

